# Rust
/target/
# The RDP helper is a workspace of its own (helpers/rdp/Cargo.toml) with its own
# build directory.
/helpers/rdp/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Cargo.lock IS committed, for both workspaces: they produce binaries, not
# libraries (see
# https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/faq.html#why-do-binaries-have-cargolock-in-version-control-but-not-libraries).
# It also stops CI re-resolving the graph on every run, which is how a `time`
# with an unfixed advisory got selected once.

# Build / packaging output
/dist/
/packaging/out/

# Editors
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.sample.json
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Local developer overrides
/.env
/.env.local
bestterm.local.toml

# UI parity reference captures: large PNGs of the reference application.
# Kept out of git; see docs/ui-parity.md for how to regenerate them locally.
/docs/ui-parity/captures/*.png
/docs/ui-parity/captures/*.jpg

# Snapshot test failures
**/snapshots/*.new.png
**/snapshots/*.diff.png

# The packaging output. Rebuilt by scripts/package-windows.sh.
